{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For the mouth.</b> It is known that פה is in construct state, and when it is in construct the hidden heh returns as a hidden yod, as in \"the mouth of the righteous\" (Psalms 37:30), likewise in the plural, \"and the mouth of the wicked\" (Proverbs 10:11), and when this yod is joined with the yod of the sign of the speaker, one is omitted, as in \"for the mouth of the speaker,\" and the meaning is that he was speaking with them in their language without an interpreter."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:03.197286967Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}